      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعاصى</span></b>  [occurs in the S and TA, voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَمَّسَ</span>, as meaning <i>He feigned disobedience,</i> or
<i>rebellion:</i> and in the A and TA, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَاغَبَ</span>,
as meaning <i>he manifested incompliance</i>].

